  "foaf:name": "Ocean Literacy With All (OLWA): the change we need for the ocean we want",
  "sdo:name": "Ocean Literacy With All (OLWA): the change we need for the ocean we want",
  "sdo:description": "OLWA advances Ocean Literacy (OL) through international partnerships and networks by designing and implementing transformative locally and globally relevant research-based activities and projects by and for diverse stakeholders. This programme builds capacity and behaviour change to achieve an ocean literate society to help ensure sustainable development of the global ocean.",
